==Trivia==
*The [[wikipedia:Calabash Nebula|Calabash Nebula]] is a nebula named for its resemblance to a fruit known as the [[wikipedia:calabash|calabash]]. The enemy base in this stage resembles the fruit.
**Matured calabash fruit would be dried and used as a container, usually to contain Chinese alcohol - this is represented as the enemy base.

